This project adapts the behavior and public tool concept of the Model Context
Protocol reference Sequential Thinking server:

  https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/tree/main/src/sequentialthinking

The reference Sequential Thinking server is licensed under the MIT License.
This adaptation replaces process-local history with explicit sequence IDs and
full-text SQLite-backed Cloudflare Durable Object storage while keeping MCP HTTP
request handling stateless.

